1 NOTE {geni:about_me}    1394. Peter Henriksson Arentz224, born 1 March 1632/33 in Bergen224; died 25 September 1710 in Kvinnherad Hordaland224. He was the son of 2788. Heinrich Arentz and 2789. Nnc. He married 1395. Sara Hansdotter Tha
2 CONC raldsen 11 July 1664 in Kvinnherad224.
2 CONT
2 CONT       1395. Sara Hansdotter Tharaldsen224, born 3 March 1643/44 in Kvinnherad224; died 19 June 1720224.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for Peter Henriksson Arentz:
2 CONT
2 CONT Sogneprest i Kvinnherad. 
2 CONT
2 CONT More About Peter Henriksson Arentz:
2 CONT
2 CONT Occupation: Sogneprest i Kvinnherad224
2 CONT
2 CONT   Notes for Sara Hansdotter Tharaldsen:
2 CONT
2 CONT [Arentz20020320.FTW] 
2 CONT
2 CONT Ho var fødd i 1644, (ny kalendar innført fyrst i år 1700). I skatteoppgavene frå baroniet Rosendal heiter det at presteenkja Sara Hansdotter levde i fattigdom på garden Nedre Røyrvik på Sunde. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Peter Arentz and Sara Tharaldsen are: 
2 CONT
2 CONT    i.   Maren Petersdotter Arentz224, born 27 June 1665 in Kvinnherad224; died 8 June 1728 in Kvinnherad224; married Claus Koren 1686224; born 1657 in Bergen224; died 25 May 1696 in Kvinnherad224. 
2 CONT
2 CONT   Notes for Maren Petersdotter Arentz:
2 CONT
2 CONT [Arentz20020320.FTW] 
2 CONT
2 CONT Hadde 5 born i første ekteskap. 
2 CONT
2 CONT    ii.   Engel Petersson Arentz224, born 1 August 1667224; married Søren Jensson Godtzen 11 February 1690/91 in Rogaland224; born 20 August 1665224. 
2 CONT
2 CONT    iii.   Berith Petersdotter Arentz224, born 20 December 1668224; died 1 January 1668/69224 
2 CONT
2 CONT    iv.   Hans Peterson Arentz224, born 24 May 1670 in Kvinnherad, Hordaland224; died 23 May 1720 in Statsbygda, Nord-Trøndelag.224; married Susanne Ottesdotter Schreuder 1698224; born 30 May 1675 in Bergen224. 
2 CONT
2 CONT   Notes for Hans Peterson Arentz:
2 CONT
2 CONT Prost i Fosen prosti. Sogneprest i Stadsbygda. 
2 CONT
2 CONT   More About Hans Peterson Arentz:
