2 CONT
2 CONT   697 v.   Riborg Petersdotter Arentz, born 26 December 1671 in Malmanger Hordaland; married (1) Nn Orning; married (2) Jens Hansson Smith Abt. 1691 in ( I Kjelda 1671 som er fødselsår). 
2 CONT
2 CONT 2788. Heinrich Arentz233, born 1584 in Hamburg/Bremen Tyskland233; died 1644 in Den tyske kyrkja i Bergen233. He was the son of 5576. Heinrich Arentz and 5577. Anna (Prestdorf) Von Broich. He married 2789. Nnc 1632 in Tyskland233.
