2 CONT Laurits Samsonsson DALL-KJERLAND was born in 1590 in Kjerland.1.Kvinnherad.Hordaland.Norway. He died before 1650 in Kjerland.1.Kvinnherad.Hordaland.Norway.  Laurits married Kristine Ivarsdatter ORM-EBNA before 1625. [Parents] 
2 CONT
2 CONT [Notes] 
2 CONT
2 CONT 2193. Kristine Ivarsdatter ORM-EBNA was born in 1600 in Ebna-Midt.Skånevik.Hordaland.Norway.. She died in Kjerland.1.Kvinnherad.Hordaland.Norway. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Laurits Kjerland SAMSONSON (AFN:ZNTP-BK)    
2 CONT
2 CONT Born:  1590  Place:  Kjerland, Kvinnherad, Hordaland, Norway 
