2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT MORGENSTIERNE, Christopher d.e.
2 CONT
2 CONT 3 Jan 1619 - 12 Nov 1679
2 CONT
2 CONT     * TITLE: d.e.
2 CONT
