1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Elisabeth Ludvigsdatter Munthe[1,2]
2 CONT
2 CONT  Home  Search  Individual  Pedigree  Descendancy  Relationship  Timeline  Login Birth  1630  Borreby, Malmohus, Sweden  [3,4]   Sex  Female   Died  1665  [5,6]   Person ID  I525  Default Tree   Last Modified  08 Dec 2002  
2 CONT
2 CONT Father  Ludvig Hanssøn Munthe, b. 2 Aug 1593, Tikob Rectory Sealand, Denmark   Mother  Ingeborg Sørensdatter Friis, b. 1590   Group Sheet  F270  Default Tree  
2 CONT
2 CONT Family 1  Christen Hanssøn Paus   Married  1649  [7]   Children    1. Hans Christensen Paus, b. Abt 1650 
2 CONT   2. Ludvig Christenssøn Paus, b. 23 Aug 1652 
2 CONT   3. Ingeborg Sophie Paus, b. Abt 1653 
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Modified  24 Aug 2003   Group Sheet  F224  Default Tree  
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes  [HANSEN.FTW] 
2 CONT
2 CONT Among the eight bishops daughters reaching adulthood she was the third oldest. Without a doubt she was born in Borreby, Scania around 1630. Named after her maternal grandmother E. Svaning. When her father died in 1649 she was stil
2 CONC l unmarried but shortly after, maybe the same year, she married Paust. She probably died around 1665. Her name was inherited by three sister-daughters 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://montanatrail.familytreeguide.com/getperson.php?personID=I525&tree=T1&PHPSESSID=1b86ae9c84ceb57fca3615e95485665a
2 CONT
2 CONT ----------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Elisabeth Ludvigsdatter Munthe  ABT 1625 - ____ BIRTH: ABT 1625, (noe usikre foreldre) Borrby, Malmöhus ?  Father: Ludvig Hansssøn Munthe  Mother: Ingeborg Sørensdatter Friis 
2 CONT
2 CONT Family 1 : Christen Hanssøn Paus  MARRIAGE: ABT 1651, (Bergen ?)  +Ludvig Christensen Paus 
2 CONT  Poul Christensen Paus  +Ingeborg Sophie Paus 
2 CONT  Dorete Christensdatter Paus 
2 CONT
