2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT      Tired of all the politics of reclaiming a title, and the complicated history thereof, Henry apparently sought out a commoner to marry and have kids with.  Her name is unknown but he did find her.  This did not mean he wasn't 
2 CONC a prince or of royal blood, just that he wasn't claiming it.
