2 CONC ond Benkestok latest by the beginning of 1450-century, when [son] Tord must have been born. She was, according to the chalkboard, which I [Tore H. Vigerust] fully trust, the daughter of Ingeborg, a daughter of Ulvilde Jonsdotter (
2 CONC Grease), ridderen Mr. Jon Wax farsøster.13 Torleiv Benkestokks mother, Bergit, led weapon ox head in rosenkrans [ Mrs Kirstine Trond dotter Benkestokks anevåpen 1572]. The same weapon was led by ridderen Mr. Peder Torleivsson, kno
