1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ID: I2729 
2 CONT
2 CONT Name: Bjørn LAURITSSON 
2 CONT
2 CONT Given Name: Bjørn 
2 CONT
2 CONT Surname: Lauritsson 
2 CONT
2 CONT NSFX: Bjørheim 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sex: M 
2 CONT
2 CONT Title: Bjørheim 
2 CONT
2 CONT Note: 
2 CONT
2 CONT Bjørn Lauritsson must have been quite a substantial citizen of Ryfylke. His father was an extremely wealthy landowner and he married into the richest family in Ryfylke.
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth: ABT 1530 in Øvre Bjørheim farm, Strand, Rogaland, Norway 
2 CONT
2 CONT Death: ABT 1596 in Øvre Bjørheim farm, Strand, Rogaland, Norway
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Laurits* LEIFSSEN b: ABT 1510 in Strand, Rogaland, Norway
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 1 Sissela SÆBJØRNSDATTER b: ABT 1540 in Nord-Talgje farm, Sjernarøy, Rogaland, Norway
2 CONT
2 CONT Married: ABT 1565 in Ryfylke, Rogaland, Norway 7 1 2
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT
2 CONT  Knut BJØRNSSON b: ABT 1565 in Øvre Bjørheim farm, Strand, Rogaland, Norway
2 CONT
2 CONT  Svend BJØRNSSON b: ABT 1568 in Strand, Rogaland, Norway
2 CONT
2 CONT  Kari BJØRNSDATTER b: ABT 1570 in Strand, Rogaland, Norway
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT
2 CONT Abbrev: Ætt- og Heim
2 CONT
