2 CONT
2 CONT 126.38.	Ole (Oluf) Hanssen Glad, f. 1688, d. 1742
2 CONT
2 CONT 127.38.	Knud Hanssen Glad, f. 1689
2 CONT
2 CONT 128.38.	Peder Hanssen Glad, f. 1690
2 CONT
2 CONT Kilde: http://www.nose.dk/Norge/toender.html#38
