1 NAME Hans /Onarheim/
2 GIVN Hans
2 SURN Onarheim
2 _MARNM Onarheim
1 NAME Hans /Jørgensson/
2 GIVN Hans
2 SURN Jørgensson
2 _MARNM Onarheim
1 SEX M
